    {
      "section": "time.clock",
      "confidence": "medium",
      "note": "Sesotho ordinal hours: 'hora ya boraro' = 3 o'clock, 'hora ya pele' = 1 o'clock, 'hora ya leshome' = 10. '... le halofo' (half, as in the file's duration data), '... le kotara' (quarter past), otherwise '... le metsotso e leshome / e mashome a mabedi / e mashome a mane a metso e mehlano'. Doubts: :45 is additive ('... le metsotso e mashome a mane a metso e mehlano') rather than a 'kotara to' form, which I could not verify; Lesotho vs South African orthography (no diacritics, matching the existing file)."
    }
